Material Design icons by Google

The 2,142 vector resources in qqq/android/mobileapp/src/main/res/drawable
use Material Design icon artwork from Google, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
Pinned upstream revision: d7a78a2ad434d5d38e1b8708c9dd9847cc3ada9b

QQQ Android integration modifications include Android resource names, dimensions,
and fill/tint presentation. Each resource's drawing path data matches its pinned
upstream source. The loading and unavailable-network illustrations use the
upstream hourglass_empty and wifi_off icons, respectively.

See docs/material-icons-provenance.json for the complete resource-to-source
mapping, SHA-256 hashes, and final styling. The upstream license is retained in
docs/third-party/material-design-icons-LICENSE.txt.

Project copyright statements cover project integration/modifications and do not
replace Google's original artwork attribution. Dependency and embedded-data
notices are included in the application's Open-source licenses settings and its
matching generated distribution report. This repository notice supplements that
report; it is not a complete dependency inventory by itself.

